### Register, login, create course, approve, add term, register, grade

POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register?email=user1@example.com&password=pass123&full_name=User%201

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=&username=user1@example.com&password=pass123&scope=&client_id=&client_secret=

### Set token
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Create course (pending)
POST http://localhost:8000/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "IIS-WIS2",
  "title": "WIS2",
  "description": "IS pro výuku",
  "type": "lecture",
  "auto_approve_until_limit": true,
  "capacity_limit": 2
}

### Admin approve course
POST http://localhost:8000/admin/courses/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List courses (public)
GET http://localhost:8000/courses

### Create term (by guarantor)
POST http://localhost:8000/courses/1/terms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Přednáška 1",
  "type": "lecture",
  "description": "Úvod",
  "date": "2025-10-06T10:00:00",
  "requires_registration": true,
  "capacity_limit": 30
}

### Register to course
POST http://localhost:8000/courses/1/register
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register to term
POST http://localhost:8000/courses/terms/1/register
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Grade user
POST http://localhost:8000/courses/terms/1/grade/1?points=95
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
